flowchart TD
    cron([Scheduled run at 2am]) --> extract[Extract source data]
    extract --> src[(Sales database)]
    extract --> clean[Clean the data]
    clean --> dup{Duplicate records?}
    dup -->|Yes| dedup[Deduplicate]
    dedup --> transform[Transform to warehouse schema]
    dup -->|No| transform
    transform --> load[Load warehouse]
    load --> dwh[(Data warehouse)]
    load --> report[Update reports]
    report --> done([Done])
    clean -.-> log[Log anomalies]
